## Open Threads

- TVL data for Berachain native apps (BEX, Bend, Berps) — DefiLlama chain page exists but native protocols not fully integrated per Phase 5; need official TVL dashboard or DefiLlama integration completion
- CEX listing specifics — Phase 3 EV-012 and TGE announcement mention CEX listings but do not name exchanges; need CoinGecko/CoinMarketCap markets tab verification post-TGE
- Daily active users / transaction count / unique wallets — Berascan shows raw data but no aggregated metrics dashboard; need Dune Analytics dashboard or official metrics page
- Developer count — GitHub contributors visible (~20 named pseudonymous + ~50 total per Phase 2) but no standardized developer activity metric (Electric Capital, etc.)
- BEX 24h volume / liquidity depth — BEX app shows individual pools but no aggregated volume/TVL dashboard visible
- IBC bridge volume / packet count — Map of Zones may have data but not verified; need on-chain query
- BGT holder / delegator count — BGT contract on Berascan but no holder analytics dashboard
- Market share metrics — No L1 market share data (TVL/volume/users) available from DefiLlama, Token Terminal, or Messari for Berachain
- Fee switch activation status — Governance-gated feature mentioned in whitepaper/docs; on-chain proposal status not verified
- Oracle provider for Bend/Berps/HONEY — Critical infrastructure dependency unidentified in all phases; need audit reports or contract verification
- Grants program / hackathon history — Not found in Phases 1-7; need official announcement or blog post search
- Non-IBC bridge integrations (Wormhole, LayerZero, Axelar, etc.) — Not documented; need partnership announcements
- Legal wrapper for DAO/governance separate from Foundation — Phase 2 shows no DAO entity; Phase 6 governance is on-chain only
- BERA circulating supply real-time — No official dashboard; CoinGecko/CoinMarketCap may show post-TGE but methodology unclear
- HONEY peg stability metrics — Historical depeg events, max deviation, recovery time not published
- Validator set transparency — Geographic distribution, entity identity, commission rates not public; only "100 validators at genesis" documented
- MEV protection status — No PBS, encrypted mempool, or MEV mitigation documented in Phase 4
- Cross-chain BERA/BGT/HONEY representations (wrapped on Ethereum, Solana, etc.) — Not documented